    "text": "Board admins and board members can draft and save a budget.\nThe draft is for one fund at a time. Start with the operating fund.\nTo save it, next year must be open in the books as a fiscal period. Until it is, you can review the draft but not save it. An HOA admin can open it in one step (below).",
