    "sectionId": "if-something-goes-wrong",
    "heading": "If something goes wrong",
    "text": "\"isn't open in the books yet\": next year has no fiscal period, so there's nowhere to save the draft. An HOA admin selects Open next fiscal year (step 2), and Save turns on. Selecting it again does nothing; it says the year is already open.\n\"Your fiscal periods aren't monthly, quarterly or yearly\": the app can't tell how to add next year to your books. Contact support to add it.\n\"Nothing to start from yet\": there's no earlier budget for this fund and no posted activity in the last 12 months, so every line starts at $0. Enter the amounts yourself; it still saves as a draft.\n\"A budget for that period and fund already exists\": that year already has a budget for this fund. Open it from Budgets instead, or choose a different year.\n\"The draft budget was created, but its lines didn't save\": select Save as draft budget again. It finishes the same draft rather than creating a second one.",
